                                                                        "resource_id": null,
                                                                        "checked": false,
                                                                        "text": "The mattress features a quilted top layer that zips off, though it's spot-clean only. It's made of organic cotton, fire-retardant wool batting, and PLA, a fiber made from non-GMO sugarcane that adds improved moisture wicking and durability. Below that is a 3-inch ",
