                                                                  "resource_id": null,
                                                                  "checked": false,
                                                                  "text": "Due to the customization of the Naturepedic EOS Classic, the assembly process is more involved than that of most beds. While most come in a single box the size of a mini fridge, the EOS Classic arrived in four smaller boxes, which made it a lot easier to carry up to my third-floor testing room and may enable you to up the bed without extra help.",
                                                                  "class": "android.view.View",
