                                                                        "resource_id": null,
                                                                        "checked": false,
                                                                        "text": "that explains the process. First, you lay the mattress encasement across your bed frame and unzip it to make room for the internal components. Next, you add the coils, squeezing them into the encasement. Then, put the latex layers on top of those, ensuring your preferred firmness is on your side of the bed. Lastly, you zip the encasement closed and lie down for a rest.",
