                                                                           ]
                                                                        ],
                                                                        "resource_id": null,
                                                                        "checked": false,
                                                                        "text": "Through several iterations of the test, the Naturepedic mattress showed impressive motion isolation. The average in my mattress testing is 7.1 on the ",
