                                                                  "resource_id": null,
                                                                  "checked": false,
                                                                  "text": "Despite sleeping warm, the Naturepedic EOS Classic Organic Mattress is an outstanding option for couples, thanks to its impressive motion isolation and edge support. The dual-sided firmness customization is ideally suited for sleeping partners with different comfort preferences. Its lengthy warranty, eco-credentials, and ability to update the firmness over time make it a smart, long-term, eco-conscious solution.",
